Lembas is an independent rewrite. The rule text in skills/lembas/SKILL.md was
written fresh. Concepts adapted from caveman include answering first, keeping
code and commands verbatim, staying on until switched off, relaxing for safety
and irreversible actions, and a pre-send checklist.
